{
  "slug": "guide",
  "name": "Guide",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Help with onboarding Claude code for new users and companies.\nStay updated with Claude code features and best practices, from within Claude code itself, learn what's new and consult how to automate your workflow.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **3 agents** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `ask` (Ask any question about Claude Code features — setup, best practices, automation, models, plugins, MCP, configuration, and more), `game-mode` (Track your Claude Code feature usage, earn levels, and see your stats), `introspect` (Introspect your project — audit lifecycle coverage, find gaps, and improve your development environment), `level-up` (See your feature roadmap and get a personalized hint on what to try next), `migrate-to-claude` (Migrate your AI coding assistant config (Cursor, Windsurf, Copilot, Continue, Aider, Cody, Codex) to Claude Code), `onboard` (Interactive getting-started walkthrough for new Claude Code users), `visualize-setup` (Generate an HTML dashboard visualizing all installed Claude Code skills, plugins, and MCP servers with usage statistics and…)\n- **Agents** (3): `doc-verifier` (Verifies reference docs have links to official Anthropic documentation and checks content accuracy against live official docs), `pr-review` (Waits for Qodo and Copilot to finish reviewing a PR, then triages comments in plan mode, fixes issues,…), `version-bump` (Bumps the plugin version in plugin.json and marketplace.json, ensuring both stay in sync)\n- **Hooks** (3): `PostToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install guide@claude-community` from `OriNachum/onboarding-claude-code`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "agent": 3,
    "hook": 3
  },
